{"id":"38c58fda0da62833","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","title":"Sobolev Space","display":"df-sobolev-space — Sobolev Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sobolev-space","aliases":["58-df-sobolev-space"],"display":"df-sobolev-space — Sobolev Space","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md]]","[[58-df-lp-space]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sobolev-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sobolev-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sobolev-space — Sobolev Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03ca577eb4c1b05e\" href=\"?note=03ca577eb4c1b05e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md\">../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,\\Omega,n,k,p,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\in V\">\\(W,\\Omega,n,k,p,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\in V\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\in V\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 的标准欧氏拓扑）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 上的 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数与限制 Lebesgue 测度）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03ca577eb4c1b05e\" href=\"?note=03ca577eb4c1b05e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md\">../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^{(\\cdot)}(\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot)\">\\(L^{(\\cdot)}(\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}\">\\(\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a> 的固定欧氏 Borel 数据，不能在同一公式中重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{n,k}=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\le k\\}\">\\(I_{n,k}=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\le k\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\">\\(|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 为本文件输出集合的规范记号；其范数在下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\)</span> 在等价类层使用，原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDerivative}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDerivative}_S\\)</span> 仍在实代表函数层使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\">\\(\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\">\\(\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\)</span> 的域上取值，为该关系的唯一等价类值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{n,k}\">\\(I_{n,k}\\)</span> 及其范数的记号只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span> 的域上使用；范数的自变量限于该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"58-df-lp-space\">58-df-lp-space</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\Bigl\\{[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}:u\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq k\\to\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;([v]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n))\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\Bigl\\{[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}:u\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq k\\to\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;([v]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n))\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists f,g\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land v=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(g,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists f,g\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land v=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(g,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):\n&amp;\\exists f\\in u\\cap\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(v;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):\n&amp;\\exists f\\in u\\cap\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(v;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n),\\\\\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&amp;\n(\\mathscr D^\\alpha u=v\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n),\\\\\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&amp;\n(\\mathscr D^\\alpha u=v\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left(\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p},&amp;1\\le p&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\max_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)},&amp;p=\\infty\n\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left(\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p},&amp;1\\le p&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\max_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)},&amp;p=\\infty\n\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently under standard domain hypotheses, Sobolev spaces arise as completions in the Sobolev norm; the displayed definition uses weak derivatives directly.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}\">\\(W^{k,p}\\)</span> 的元素现在是相对于限制 Lebesgue 测度的 a.e. 等价类，而弱导数谓词作用于其函数代表元；不再把商空间元素直接当作函数。</li>\n<li>They provide the right setting for PDE theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"03ca577eb4c1b05e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-lp-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"03ca577eb4c1b05e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-weak-derivative.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^{(\\cdot)}(\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot)$ and $\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}$ (see [[58-df-lp-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n$、$\\mathcal B_\\Omega$、$\\lambda_\\Omega$ 使用 [[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]] 的固定欧氏 Borel 数据，不能在同一公式中重新选择。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-lp-space","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AeClass}$ 取 [[58-df-lp-space]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,\\Omega,n,k,p,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L^{(\\cdot)}(\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"I_{n,k}=\\{\\alpha\\in\\omega^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)\\le k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\alpha|=\\sum_{i\\in n}\\alpha(i)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDerivative}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr D^\\alpha u","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"I_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,k,p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land k\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\land W=\\Bigl\\{[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}:u\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land[u]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(|\\alpha|\\leq k\\to\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;([v]_{\\sim_{\\lambda_\\Omega\\mathrm{-a.e.}}}\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n))\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land\\alpha\\in\\omega^n\\\\\n&\\land\\exists f,g\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land v=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(g;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(g,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}carrier\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega):\n&\\exists f\\in u\\cap\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\\\\n&\\bigl(\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(v;\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\\in L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{WeakDerivative}_S(v,f,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&\n\\exists!v\\;\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n),\\\\\nu\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\land\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}\\to{}&\n(\\mathscr D^\\alpha u=v\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{WeakDerivativeClass}_S(v,u,\\alpha,\\Omega,n)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}norm}\\vdash\n\\|u\\|_{W^{k,p}(\\Omega)}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\left(\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^p(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)}^p\\right)^{1/p},&1\\le p<\\infty,\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\max_{\\alpha\\in I_{n,k}}\\|\\mathscr D^\\alpha u\\|_{L^\\infty(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)},&p=\\infty\n\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in W^{k,p}(\\Omega)).","display":true},{"tex":"W^{k,p}","display":false}],"bytes":4843,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc7c265cbb3f6c8f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"340d68d16ad589e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"212cd08391c68bb4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e06256d3696011c6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dd57a5a7ae7f9189","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u\\in H^1_{\\mathrm{loc}}(\\Omega)$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]])"},{"id":"31fd6b10afa244b4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a1f6d4733dbaf832","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e7bde29df78fed04","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)$ (Sobolev space, see [[58-df-sobolev-space]])"},{"id":"bfb4dca042a4697a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W^{k,p}(\\Omega)$ 及范数使用 [[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]；$L^q(\\Omega)=L^q(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega)$。$C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)$、其范数及 $\\mathrm{HolderRepresentative}_S$ 